OL,3,GNEWSAPlans submitted to transform
OL,4,Aiconic former department store
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn iconic former department store that
OL,7,Ftraded for more than 180 years before
OL,8,Fits closure could be transformed into a
OL,9,Fnew cultural and community hub with a
OL,10,Flibrary and exhibition space, under new
OL,11,Fplans.
OL,13,FAustins, in the Diamond area of
OL,14,FLondonderry, closed more than 10 years
OL,15,Fago after the business went into
OL,16,Fliquidation.
OL,18,FLast year, the building, one of Derry's
OL,19,Fmost recognisable landmarks, was bought
OL,20,Fby the Inner City Trust with the aim of
OL,21,Frestoring the listed building back to
OL,22,Fits former glory.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
